    # "Adara leapt forward, tightly hugging me."
    "아다라가 앞으로 뛰어들어 나를 꼭 껴안았다."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:130
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_9539da89:

    # MC "Whoa! What's brought this on?"
    MC "우와! 갑자기 왜 이래?"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:131
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_c0ae1f59:

    # ADARA "Just ... {i}Happy that you're here.{/i}"
    ADARA "그냥 ... {i}네가 여기 있어서 행복해.{/i}"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:132
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_e35ca9ec:

    # "Adara took a deep breath as she nestled her face into my chest."
    "아다라는 얼굴을 내 가슴에 파묻으며 깊은 숨을 들이쉬었다."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:133
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_ff2c5b2d:

    # ADARA "You smell really nice."
    ADARA "향기가 정말 좋네요."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:134
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_2d204a49:

    # MC "..."
    MC "..."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:135
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_14c6e5bd:

    # "Realising what she said, Adara pulled away abruptly."
    "자신이 한 말을 깨닫고, 아다라는 갑자기 몸을 뗐다."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:140
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_51e6c046:

    # ADARA @ shock "U-Uhh!"
    ADARA @ shock "어-어!"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:141
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_18f2fbfe:

    # ADARA @ shame "S-Sorry."
    ADARA @ shame "미-미안해."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:142
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_7092f841:

    # ADARA @ shame "I don't know what came over me."
    ADARA @ shame "왜 그랬는지 나도 몰라."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:145
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_1ae2a282:

    # ADARA @ joy "T-Thanks..."
    ADARA @ joy "고-고마워..."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:146
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_31f59c82:

    # ADARA @ shame "(Gods, I'm going to die of embarrassement!)"
    ADARA @ shame "(맙소사, 부끄러워 죽겠어!)"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:147
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_a5e19cd0:

    # ADARA @ shame "(I can't believe I just said that!)"
    ADARA @ shame "(내가 방금 그런 말을 하다니 믿을 수가 없어!)"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:149
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_484db046:

    # ADARA @ smile "J-Just wanted to wish you a happy Krishana day I guess..."
    ADARA @ smile "그-그냥 크리샤나 날을 축하해 주고 싶었던 것 같아..."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:150
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_d64c644f:

    # "Adara paused sheepishly, her hands clasping at her dress tightly."
    "아다라는 부끄러워하며 잠시 멈춰 서서, 원피스를 꼭 움켜쥐었다."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:151
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_7a497736:

    # ADARA @ shame "I was wondering if perhaps maybe we c-could..."
    ADARA @ shame "혹시 우리가 ㄱ-그럴 수 있을지 생각 중이었어..."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:152
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_54779c02:

    # ADARA @ joy "G-Go for a walk?"
    ADARA @ joy "ㄱ-산책할까?"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:154
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_7c3775eb:

    # MC @ lewd "Where shall we head to?"
    MC @ lewd "어디로 갈까?"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:155
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_0abbaba0:

    # ADARA @ smile "There's quite a lot going on at the Market I'm told, perhaps we should head there?"
    ADARA @ smile "시장에 꽤 볼 만한 게 많다고 들었는데, 거기로 가볼까?"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:156
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_ce53fb2e:

    # MC @ smile2 "Alright, that sounds good to me."
    MC @ smile2 "좋아, 그거 괜찮네."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:159
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_a3ef7502:

    # "The two of us made our way through the winding Novaras streets, the gentle snow falling onto the ground as children hurried through excitedly to meet their friends."
    "우리 둘은 구불구불한 노바라스의 거리를 걸어갔다. 부드러운 눈이 땅에 내리고 아이들은 친구들을 만나러 신나서 서둘러 다녔다."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:165
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_042dbacd:

    # "At the Market, it was like a kind of festive carnival."
    "시장은 마치 축제 카니발 같았다."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:166
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_e76869d8:

    # "Merchants, roasted meat over open fires that filled the air with a sweet aroma, with small crowds gathering around eager for a taste."
    "상인들, 모닥불에 구운 고기에서 달콤한 향이 공기를 가득 채우고, 맛을 보려는 작은 무리가 주위에 모여들었다."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:167
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_c36b411f:

    # "Children hurried around, throwing snowballs at their friends, parents watched and chatted amongst themselves from afar."
    "아이들은 친구들에게 눈덩이를 던지며 뛰어다녔고, 부모들은 멀리서 지켜보며 서로 이야기를 나누었다."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:168
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_be8b2752:

    # "One merchant with huge mead barrels opened, poured patrons small cups who huddled together and laughed to themselves merrily."
    "거대한 벌꿀 술통을 든 상인이 그것을 열더니, 단골들에게 작은 잔에 따라 주었고, 그들은 서로 모여 즐겁게 웃음을 터뜨렸다."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:169
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_3d1b9cdc:

    # "For a brief moment in time, it was as though everyone forgot about the wars existence outside these city walls..."
    "잠시 동안, 모두가 이 성벽 밖에 전쟁이 존재한다는 사실을 잊은 듯했다..."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:170
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_da28cac1:

    # ADARA @ smile "Isn't it nice to see everyone out and so cheery?"
    ADARA @ smile "다들 밖에 나와 이렇게 즐거워하는 모습을 보니 좋지 않나요?"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:171
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_684e7350:

    # MC @ think "The last time it was like this was when-"
    MC @ think "지난번에 이랬던 때는 언제였더라-"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:172
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_db480df9:

    # "I pushed the thought of the Terminus ceremony to the back of my mind."
    "나는 터미너스 의식에 대한 생각을 마음 구석으로 밀어 넣었다."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:173
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_1833ec0b:

    # "This was a happy time."
    "지금은 행복한 시간이었다."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:174
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_681613ed:

    # ADARA @ smile "Look at this place! Isn't it wonderful?"
    ADARA @ smile "이곳을 봐! 정말 멋지지 않아?"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:175
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_8c941941:

    # "I smiled as the children chasing each other with snowballs hurried out in front of us."
    "눈덩이를 들고 서로 쫓아다니는 아이들이 우리 앞으로 허겁지겁 뛰어나오자 나는 미소 지었다."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:176
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_99be07bb:

    # MC @ smile2 "Yes, it's nice."
    MC @ smile2 "응, 좋다."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:177
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_149e2884:

    # ADARA @ joy "What should we do now?"
    ADARA @ joy "이제 우리 뭐 할까?"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:181
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_664cc199:

    # "The time went by quickly as we had fun, it was always easy letting time drift by with Adara."
    "우리가 즐거워하는 동안 시간이 빠르게 흘렀어, Adara와 함께라면 언제나 시간이 흘러가는 걸 잊기 쉬웠지."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:183
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_c8fe2941:

    # MAD_PROPHET "GATHER! GATHER ALL!"
    MAD_PROPHET "모여라! 모두 모여!"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:189
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_397e2913:

    # ADARA @ shock "Isn't he cold wearing so little in this weather?"
    ADARA @ shock "이 날씨에 그렇게 얇게 입고 춥지 않아?"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:190
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_58374c5f:

    # MAD_PROPHET "Come and hear the tale of Krishana the ice dragon!"
    MAD_PROPHET "얼음 용 Krishana의 이야기를 들으러 오세요!"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:191
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_5506bc64:

    # ADARA @ smile "What do you think? Wanna listen?"
    ADARA @ smile "어때? 들어볼래?"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:198
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_53aaa9a4:

    # "The two of us stepped closer and joined the growing crowd, mainly comprised of children but a few adults lingered."
    "우리 둘은 가까이 다가가 점점 커지는 군중에 합류했어. 주로 아이들로 구성되었지만 몇몇 어른들도 머물고 있었지."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:199
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_8b9e7ec0:

    # MAD_PROPHET "And so we begin, centuries long past, Krishana, the great ice dragon, sat on her ice throne in the mountains of Angmurus!"
    MAD_PROPHET "그리하여 시작합니다, 수백 년 전, 위대한 얼음 용 Krishana는 Angmurus 산맥의 얼음 왕좌에 앉아 있었지!"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:200
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_7a95d963:

    # MAD_PROPHET "{i}Bored!{/i}"
    MAD_PROPHET "{i}지루해!{/i}"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:201
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_e98b016a:

    # "The crowd laughed a little."
    "군중이 조금 웃었다."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:202
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_b6989b01:

    # MAD_PROPHET "{i}'I know!'{/i} Thought the mighty dragon, {i}'I shall see what the humans down south are up to!'{/i}"
    MAD_PROPHET "{i}'알겠다!'{/i} 위대한 용은 생각했지, {i}'남쪽 아래에 있는 인간들이 뭘 하는지 보러 가야겠어!'{/i}"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:203
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_e6c8eed8:

    # MAD_PROPHET "As her mighty wings soared, she headed down south, perching herself up on a small mountain, watching the villagers down below!"
    MAD_PROPHET "그녀의 강력한 날개를 펼쳐 남쪽으로 날아 내려가, 작은 산에 앉아 아래 마을 사람들을 바라보았다!"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:204
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_5452de45:

    # MAD_PROPHET "The people revered but feared the mighty dragons! And each parent warned the children not to approach the great Krishana!"
    MAD_PROPHET "사람들은 강력한 용들을 존경하지만 두려워했다! 그리고 모든 부모는 아이들에게 위대한 크리샤나에게 다가가지 말라고 경고했다!"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:205
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_bf4a2f15:

    # MAD_PROPHET "Some young children, brave and adventurous, ignoring their parents advice, scaled the small mountain and approached the dragoness!"
    MAD_PROPHET "어떤 용감하고 모험심 강한 어린 아이들은 부모의 충고를 무시하고 작은 산을 올라 용녀에게 다가갔다!"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:206
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_7e9a0589:

    # MAD_PROPHET "{i}'But what brings you small humans here?'{/i} The dragoness asked!"
    MAD_PROPHET "{i}'하지만 작은 인간들이 여기 온 이유가 뭐지?'{/i} 용녀가 물었다!"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:207
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_aa79a142:

    # MAD_PROPHET "{i}'Oh great Krishana! It has not snowed in these lands for so long! Can you not make it so?{/i}"
    MAD_PROPHET "{i}'오 위대한 크리샤나! 이 땅에 눈이 오지 않은 지 너무 오래되었습니다! 눈을 내리게 할 수 없나요?{/i}"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:208
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_5fa83f8d:

    # MAD_PROPHET "The dragon laughed, and laughed and laughed!"
    MAD_PROPHET "용은 웃고 또 웃고 또 웃었다!"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:209
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_7ecbd013:

    # MAD_PROPHET "{i}But what in return shall thy give thee?{/i} The dragoness asked."
    MAD_PROPHET "{i}하지만 대가로 무엇을 주겠느냐?{/i} 용녀가 물었다."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:210
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_1a3da702:

    # MAD_PROPHET "{i}For my hordes of gold are vast, and I never suffer hunger long!{/i}"
    MAD_PROPHET "{i}내 황금 더미는 방대하고, 나는 결코 오래 굶주리지 않는다!{/i}"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:211
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_ef09375e:

    # MAD_PROPHET "{i}What could you possibly have to offer me?{/i}"
    MAD_PROPHET "{i}네가 나에게 줄 수 있는 게 도대체 뭐가 있겠느냐?{/i}"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:212
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_8f1a64cc:

    # MAD_PROPHET "The children looked amongst themselves for a moment, till one stepped forward and offered the great Krishana a small stone."
    MAD_PROPHET "아이들은 잠시 서로를 바라보다가, 한 아이가 앞으로 나서 위대한 크리샤나에게 작은 돌을 바쳤다."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:213
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_70d2ab96:

    # MAD_PROPHET "{i}But what is this?{/i} The dragoness asked."
    MAD_PROPHET "{i}그런데 이게 뭐지?{/i} 용녀가 물었다."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:214
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_d33e7b2d:

    # MAD_PROPHET "{i}It is a waystone!{/i} the child answered!"
    MAD_PROPHET "{i}이건 길잡이 돌이야!{/i} 아이가 대답했다!"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:215
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_60db9f86:

    # MAD_PROPHET "{i}So no matter where you fly, you will always be able to find your way home here!{/i}"
    MAD_PROPHET "{i}그러니 네가 어디를 날든, 항상 여기로 집을 찾아올 수 있을 거야!{/i}"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:216
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_9e7dd2b0:

    # MAD_PROPHET "Krishana took the small gift, and boomed, {i}'HOME? HERE? FOR ME?'{/i}"
    MAD_PROPHET "크리샤나는 작은 선물을 받고, 우렁차게 말했다, {i}'집? 여기가? 나를 위해?'{/i}"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:217
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_0229275b:

    # MAD_PROPHET "The dragoness, so touched by the gift, said with a cool blow of air, {i}I've never had a home before.{/i}"
    MAD_PROPHET "용녀는 선물에 너무 감동하여, 시원한 바람을 내뿜으며 말했다, {i}나는 한 번도 집을 가져본 적이 없어.{/i}"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:218
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_2bb02a72:

    # MAD_PROPHET "Before the children could answer, the mighty Kirshana unleashed her icy breath into the sky, and the children celebrated as the snow fell down!"
    MAD_PROPHET "아이들이 대답하기도 전에, 강력한 크리샤나는 하늘에 얼음 숨결을 내뿜었고, 눈이 내리자 아이들이 환호했다!"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:219
translate kr ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_dda3abaf:

    # MAD_PROPHET "And so it was, Krishana returned every year to bring forth the snow in exchange for the children's gifts!"
